The pattern/logic followed here is:

0.15 + 0.5 = 0.20;

0.20 + 0.10 = 0.30;

0.30 + 0.15 = 0.45;

0.45 + 0.20 = 0.65;

0.65 + 0.25 = **0.90**

Hence, the next number in the series is ‘0.90’.

We know that, a³ – b³ = (a – b) (a² + ab + b²)

⇒ a³ – b³ = (a – b) (a² + ab + b² + ab - ab) 

⇒ a³ – b³ = (a – b) (a² + 2ab + b² – ab)

⇒ a³ – b³ = (a – b) {(a + b)² – ab)}

⇒ 208 = 8 × {(a + b)² – ab)}

⇒ {(a + b)² – ab)} = 208/8 = 26
